 Requirements for Caregivers- Pediatric First-Aid and Pediatric CPR (26 TAC §747.1303(2)(A))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1465290-i20260616-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-3703-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1465290-i20260616","date":"2026-06-16","original_code":"747.3703(a)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-19","finding":"Animals at Center - Documentation of Vaccinations: The most recent vaccination records was not available for 2 of the three dogs in the home.","topic":"health","source_record_id":"1026399086","violation_type_title":"Animals at Center - Documentation of Vaccinations (26 TAC §747.3703(a))","topic_label":"Health records & medication"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1465290-i20260616-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-801-7","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1465290-i20260616","date":"2026-06-16","original_code":"747.801(7)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-23","finding":"Records Maintained and Made Available - Safety Drills Documentation: The are no documented severe weather or lock down drills for 2025. There are no documented fire drills monthly for 2025 or 2026 either. Monthly documentation for fire extinguishers being inspected was not documented for 2025 or 2026.  Monthly documentation of smoke detector and carbon monoxide detector being inspected monthly was not documented for 2025 or 2026.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026359010","violation_type_title":"Records Maintained and Made Available - Safety Drills Documentation (26 TAC §747.801(7))","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1465290-i20241205","date":"2024-12-05","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":5,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905